    52	
    53	The following processing was applied to both the SeLECTS casecontrol cohort and the devCCNP normal datasets. Structural MRI processing pipelines were primarily built using FreeSurfer (Fischl et al. 2001) and FSL (Smith et al. 2004). T1-weight data processing included cortical segmentation and surface reconstruction analyses. Anatomical surfaces were generated from the individual T1w image in native space using the recon-all command in FreeSurfer. Estimation of individual morphometric measures included the total intracranial volume, regional subcortical volume ( n =14), regional cortical thickness ( n =68), and surface area ( n =68).
